Usinas de Beneficiamento de Minérios do Brasil — CETEM (@mine-plants: 0, is #reference, #part-of @mine-sources) { r_62ZD994C9YYXB1YDVFQST5B27J
João Alves Sampaio, Adão Benvindo da Luz, and Fernando Antonio Freitas Lins, editors. Usinas de Beneficiamento de Minérios do Brasil. CETEM/MCT, Rio de Janeiro, 2001, 398 pages. ISBN 85-7227-141-4. [Official repository and authorized edition](https://mineralis.cetem.gov.br/handle/cetem/2037).

Read the complete book as a collection of integrated plant cases, connecting feed mineralogy, flowsheets, equipment, streams, utilities, products, and operational observations. Reconstruct selected complete cases quantitatively and compare the assumptions and data basis. Historical plant descriptions do not establish current operating conditions or equipment.

The official CETEM technical bibliography identifies this edition and source route. Preserve actual publisher and component notices; free source access is not assumed to confer unrestricted adaptation. Metadata checked on 29 October 2026. No case datasets, figures, plant documents, or book PDF is bundled.

**Return:** [Mining and mineral engineering sources — books, courses, methods, and evidence](../Sources.lingua#r_5368N4FVSGP1G4DP5612SJD0M5).
